{"2727960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pirates & Pirater", "steam_appid": 2727960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍖 Cook. Eat. Conquer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just a pirate, <strong>you’re a culinary marauder</strong>. In <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>, every battle begins in the kitchen. <strong>Craft</strong> edible weapons, <strong>chow</strong> down on your arsenal, and bring laughter to the high seas in a tongue-in-cheek <strong>Action-Adventure like no other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ What Makes It Different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cutlasses of steel, your cutlass might be made of crayfish. Your pistol? A lime. <strong>Every weapon you create can be eaten</strong> for strange buffs, leaving you to decide whether to fight with your masterpiece… <strong>or snack on it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.poster.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.webm?t=1782059875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.mp4?t=1782059875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🍳 Cook Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix <strong>ingredients</strong> into ridiculous weapon recipes. From banana blades to mushroom cannons, every dish has <strong>unique stats, effects, and flavor.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🍕 Pirate Comedy Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a ridiculous story across <strong>Gustav’s Archipelago</strong> where pirates take their cooking <strong>very seriously.</strong> Expect slapstick <strong>encounters</strong>, absurd <strong>dialogue</strong>, and plenty of seafaring <strong>shenanigans</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/9610442e273d5ad20ec06a4c67f27ad1.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🏆 Fight with Flavor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bite matters.</strong> Eating your weapons changes combat strategy, turning meals into power-ups.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🌍 Stylized World, Relatable Humor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, offbeat setting packed with visual gags, silly details, and plenty of Easter eggs for players who love discovering the absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.poster.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.webm?t=1782059875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.mp4?t=1782059875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💡 Why You’ll Thank the Chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’ve ever wanted an <strong>Action-Adventure</strong> that doesn’t take itself too seriously, <i><strong>Pirates &amp; Pirater</strong></i> serves up the perfect recipe: satisfying combat, absurd creativity, and a story that makes you laugh as much as it makes you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚓ Coming Soon to the High Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning of the feast. Future updates may expand recipes, add new bosses, and spice up the story with new missions and side quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlisting now</strong> ensures you don’t miss what’s cooking next!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/16ac881dedb261cbd81602dce0c235e8.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍖 Cook. Eat. Conquer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just a pirate, <strong>you’re a culinary marauder</strong>. In <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>, every battle begins in the kitchen. <strong>Craft</strong> edible weapons, <strong>chow</strong> down on your arsenal, and bring laughter to the high seas in a tongue-in-cheek <strong>Action-Adventure like no other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1782059875\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ What Makes It Different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cutlasses of steel, your cutlass might be made of crayfish. Your pistol? A lime. <strong>Every we